  "result": "Excellent! All 321 tests pass.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Enhanced `src/money.js`** with foreign currency support:\n\n**Added `RATES` constant**:\n- `EUR: 1` (base currency)\n- `USD: 1.085` (units of USD per euro)\n- `GBP: 0.8425` (units of GBP per euro)\n\n**Added `convert(cents, currency)` function**:\n- Converts euro cents to another currency's cents\n- Returns `ok(convertedCents)` or `fail('UNKNOWN_CURRENCY')`\n- Uses `roundCents()` to ensure whole cents result\n- Example: `convert(10000, 'USD')` \u2192 `ok(10850)`\n\n**Added `formatMoney(cents, currency)` function**:\n- Formats amounts in any currency for display\n- Uses `$` for USD, `\u00a3` for GBP, `\u20ac` for EUR\n- Falls back to currency code for unknown currencies\n- Shows thousands separator and 2 decimals\n- Example: `formatMoney(108500, 'USD')` \u2192 `$1,085.00`\n\n**Added 21 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- RATES constant values\n- EUR pass-through (no conversion)\n- USD and GBP conversion from EUR\n- Small and large amounts\n- Unknown and malformed currency codes\n- Formatting with correct symbols and separators\n- Negative amounts with minus sign\n- Precision and rounding\n- Two decimal places always\n- Currency scaling (USD > EUR, GBP < EUR)\n- Integration between convert and formatMoney\n\n**Test results**: 321 tests passing (300 existing + 21 new) \u2713",
